  "findings": [
    "All 54 non-crypto, 15 crypto and 18 extra labels match the complete original macro bodies in the original order. The immutable HAVE_OPENSSL choice gives 72 or 87 actual bool entries and places PERMISSION_MODEL at the corresponding index.",
    "Parse copies cats, then each real prefix substring, applies original classic-locale case conversion, checks each available category with find, publishes only true, and advances after the comma. Empty input, leading/repeated comma, trailing comma, substring and later Parse behavior follow that exact loop.",
    "ToLower(#name) deduces the actual literal array and traverses its terminal NUL. The production keeps that byte; ToLower(cats substring) traverses only the actual string extent. No C-string shortcut or different case-fold policy was introduced.",
    "Parse(environment) creates the original native empty cats String, invokes the genuine selected SafeGetenv NODE_DEBUG_NATIVE path, then parses its result. The explicit parse_text embedding String prefix and absence of a RealEnvStore fallback remain documented.",
    "The selected Inserting %s call borrows its original native String span. SizedString creates the owning copy at ToStringHelper conversion after the formatter ret prefix local; it does not add a separate pre-format input copy. Tree lines use the original two c_str operands and their C-string extent.",
    "The selected SPrintF recursive expression, prefix construction, conversion/append and final recursion ordering are preserved for the two Permission literals and string operands. Permission retains its outer enabled check, the inner Debug check and each actual tree-line check.",
    "FWrite is exactly the original complete function after only the EnvironmentString and Allocator<wchar_t> type substitutions. It retains actual FILE identity, Windows tty detection and UTF-8 conversion, native console versus fwrite selection, ignored I/O results and absence of an added flush.",
    "Local lists and the process selection buffer retain actual inline bool state. The process feature is fixed before publication; native category String statics have their original process lifetime. This algorithm review does not independently close shared native allocator ownership."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Source-only; no compilation, test execution, actual stdout/stderr or Windows-console observation.",
    "Only the admitted Windows/Linux, release-mode selected Permission String/C-string formatting path is covered. General numeric/pathlike/pointer formatting and malformed-format full compiler-generated assertion diagnostics are not qualified.",
    "Actual native allocation/guard lifetime, singleton installation, native Environment assembly, RealEnvStore, full startup and public process behavior remain separate peers/dependencies.",
    "Original loop-end DCHECKs and valid-index DCHECK-only checks do not add a new release-mode behavior here; this receipt does not claim a debug-build assertion equivalence."
  ]
